    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHO ARE YOU, REALLY?</strong></h2><br>XIII is the remake of the iconic action game played in first person view initially released in 2003. You play as \u201cXIII\u201d, a man with no identity, in a single player campaign full of twists and turns. Inspired by the eponymous comic book, the game features a unique cel-shading design entirely reinvented. XIII will also offer the possibility to confront your opponents through brutal multiplayer battles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/9aef7fd0f2c0589ef68a327a9e658b49.poster.avif?t=1724164827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/9aef7fd0f2c0589ef68a327a9e658b49.webm?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/9aef7fd0f2c0589ef68a327a9e658b49.mp4?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The country is still in shock after <strong>the assassination of President Sheridan</strong>. You wake up wounded, without any memory, on a deserted beach of the west coast. The only clues to your identity are <strong>the number XIII tattooed near your collarbone</strong> and a locker key. Despite your amnesia, you discover that you have the reflexes of a fully trained professional fighter. You take the road seeking for pieces of your past, finding out that you played a role in the murder of the President of the United States and uncovering the most horrific conspiracy in the entire history of the country.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  The remake of the 2003 cult FPS initially released on PC, PlayStation 2, Xbox and Nintendo Gamecube.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  A new artistic direction that respects the original work and its iconic cel-shading design.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  Numerous references to the eponymous graphic novel, with onomatopoeia, speech bubbles, panels and more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/42b0a1c4f7b48213187a3468f604777b.poster.avif?t=1724164827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/42b0a1c4f7b48213187a3468f604777b.webm?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/42b0a1c4f7b48213187a3468f604777b.mp4?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  Music and voices from the original version.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  A conspiracy-based plot with numerous twists and turns.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  Varied gameplay with action, infiltration and exploration phases.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/9a2c9896e3ac9e5fec6c93a22b5ec6fb.poster.avif?t=1724164827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/9a2c9896e3ac9e5fec6c93a22b5ec6fb.webm?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/9a2c9896e3ac9e5fec6c93a22b5ec6fb.mp4?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  A breathtaking solo campaign with 34 levels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  A brutal arsenal of 15 weapons to get your memory back.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/ea14738b4082b45ef6197db6594e0b41.poster.avif?t=1724164827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/ea14738b4082b45ef6197db6594e0b41.webm?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/ea14738b4082b45ef6197db6594e0b41.mp4?t=1724164827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154790/extras/15de0a170e3cbe5acf0d9fbbc9017276.webp?t=1724164827\" /></div>  Fierce 